text = "Mr. Man is an incrediby powerful being from another galaxy who's been summoned to this galaxy to help defend against the pasta. In this process he lost all his powers, but his luxurios legs remained and can be used to do a dash.

TIP: Mr. Man is one of the only reliable counters to the projectiles."
